# Oblivious Bookworm: "entered the battlefield face down ... this turn". The manifested Llanowar Elves entered face down
# on turn 1 and is still face down on turn 3, but nothing entered face down or was turned face up on turn 3, so the
# end-step draw is followed by a discard. The same opening as the scenario that turns the Elves face up in response,
# without the turning up: that one keeps the Counterspell, this one must discard a card and discards it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Llanowar Elves
Turn Inside Out
Lightning Bolt
Oblivious Bookworm
Llanowar Elves
Island
Forest
Counterspell
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Turn Inside Out.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Arrange(Llanowar Elves | Island)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Oblivious Bookworm.Cast
[T3 Bot1.End]
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Choose(Counterspell)

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Hand.Count = 0
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
Bot1.Graveyard.Count = 6
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDown = true
Bot1.Battlefield..FaceDownName = Llanowar Elves
